left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics" as FAFR003
  usecase "SFR002: Deliver Personalized Recommendations" as SFR002
  usecase "AIFR004: Generate Investment Opportunity Analyses" as AIFR004
  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback" as CFR011

  Client --> (View Financial Insights Dashboard)
  Client --> (Receive Alerts about Anomalous Transactions)
  Client --> (View Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Current Market Trends)
  Client --> (Receive Personalized Recommendations Aligned with My Financial Profile and Goals)
  Client --> (Manage Personalized Recommendations Preferences to Ensure the System Provides Insights Relevant to My Financial Objectives and Risk Tolerance as Defined in My KYC (Know Your Customer) Profile)
  Client --> (View Spending Limit Alerts When I Exceed Predefined Thresholds in Specific Expense Categories)
  Client --> (View Investment Opportunities Suitable to My Risk Profile)
  Client --> (View News Related to My Investment Portfolio)
  Client --> (Access a Personalized Dashboard That Consolidates My Financial Information in a Single View)
  Client --> (Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors, Including Permissions for Sharing My Financial Data)

  SystemAdmin --> SAFR001
  SystemAdmin --> CFR011

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003
  FinancialAdvisor --> SFR002
  FinancialAdvisor --> AIFR004
  FinancialAdvisor --> CFR011

  User -> (Send Feedback About the System's Recommendations and Insights)
}

